        "content": "## ⚡ LinkedIn Prospect Recent Posts Scraper for AI Cold Email Icebreakers\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nFetch a prospect’s latest LinkedIn posts before sending an outbound sequence so GPT-4o/Claude can write hyper-personalized first lines.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/linkedin-profile-posts-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/linkedin-profile-posts-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify LinkedIn Profile Posts Scraper (No Cookies)** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract live structured JSON records!",
